OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer charged with sexual
OL,4,Aassault
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer has been charged two
OL,7,Fcounts of sexual assault.
OL,9,FPC Austin Travis, 29, who works for
OL,10,FThames Valley Police at High Wycombe
OL,11,Fstation, was charged on 21 September
OL,12,Fand has been suspended from duty.
OL,14,FThe charges follow reports made by two
OL,15,Fpeople known to Travis alleging
OL,16,Fincidents in Oxford city centre in
OL,17,FNovember 2025 while he was off duty.
OL,19,FTravis is due to appear at Luton
OL,20,FMagistrates' Court on Thursday.
